Developed by the Kube-DC team (https://kube-dc.com).

This product implements the HPE CSI Driver Container Storage Provider API
(https://github.com/hpe-storage/container-storage-provider, Apache-2.0).
The Helm chart can install the HPE CSI Driver for Kubernetes
(https://github.com/hpe-storage/co-deployments, Apache-2.0) as a dependency.

